@startuml
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
autonumber

participant "Server" as S
participant "Broadcast (All Clients)" as B

== FinalScoringState Entry ==

S ->> B: onPhaseChanged(phase: PhaseType.END_GAME)

note over S: Server notifies PhaseObservers\nBuildingEffects with END_GAME effects activate

loop for each active BuildingEffect (PhaseObserver)
    S ->> B: onPlayerResourceChanged(nickname: String, resource: String, newValue: int, delta: int)
end

note over S: FinalScoringState.onEntryActions() triggered

== Final Score Calculation ==

note over S: calculateFinalScores()

loop for each Player
    S ->> B: onFinalScoreCalculated(nickname: String, ppFromBuilders: int, ppFromBuildings: int, ppFromInventors: int, ppFromArtists: int, ppFromBuildingEffects: int, totalPrestigePoints: int, remainingFood: int)
end

== Winner Proclamation ==

note over S: determineWinner()

S ->> B: onGameEnded(winners: List<String>, finalRankings: List<PlayerFinalScore>)

note over S #Red: Game Ended

@enduml